    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop running\" sounds nice but it feels impossible. like if i stop i just drown in all the stuff i owe. everything is just constant pressure. i keep thinking that if i just stopped everything... if i didn't have to deal with any of this anymore... wouldn't that just be the only logical way out? like, if the cost of existing is more than you have, what are you even supposed to do?",
